Applications that come with a GUI

viewer			RSML viewer, tkinter desktop app (run $python3 rsml_viewer.py)
estimate 		tool for estimating root parameters from 2d images, tkinter desktop app (run $python3 estimate.py)
rsml_viewer		RSML viewer, Dash web app (run $python3 main.py)
cplantbox		plant simulation dashboard, Dash web app (run $python3 main.py, or wsgi.py for deployment)

